    <briefdescription>
<para>The custom lattice function used by the generic sparse propagation solver. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It handles merging lattice values and computing new lattice values for constants, arguments, values returned from trackable functions, and values located in trackable global variables. It also computes the lattice values that change as a result of executing instructions. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
